# Frontend stack
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript strict mode
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- Zustand
- TanStack Query
- Zod
- WebSocket client

# Frontend conventions
- Build reusable components.
- Keep state normalized.
- Use typed hooks for streaming data.
- Render agent outputs progressively.
- Match the dark precision design system.

# UI rules
- Include loading, error, reconnect, and empty states.
- Validate all incoming messages.
- Keep dashboard cards visually consistent.
